(421035, 37987, 9809, '<td valign="top">I like the concept &amp; the message, but the cross -- the whole picture is flat and lifeless. Kind of the antithesis of "Life." The choice to crop it at the edge of the cross left and right, but leave distance top and bottom -- and different distances to boot, doesn''t help the image either. Perhaps a unique angle shot from below with the sun rising in the background -- maybe just peaking over the edge of the board background. Yeah, that would have been cool.</td>', 'I like the concept & the message, but the cross -- the whole picture is flat and lifeless. Kind of the antithesis of "Life." The choice to crop it at the edge of the cross left and right, but leave distance top and bottom -- and different distances to boot, doesn''t help the image either. Perhaps a unique angle shot from below with the sun rising in the background -- maybe just peaking over the edge of the board background. Yeah, that would have been cool.', '2003-09-17 01:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(421036, 37917, 8624, '<td valign="top">great lighting. I would have liked the background blurred out more as the other leaves compete with the main subject in the foreground.</td>', 'great lighting. I would have liked the background blurred out more as the other leaves compete with the main subject in the foreground.', '2003-09-17 01:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
