(421171, 38013, 7151, '<td valign="top">You''re picture is *way* over compressed, which mars an otherwise interesting idea.  Your image is only 14k - it can be up to 150k.  Use as much of that space as you can.  Beyond that...  An interesting idea, pulled off reasonably well.  Normally, I''d say the moon was over-exposed, but it works for effect here.  The lights - that''s a tough call.  The fact that they aren''t straight bothers me at first, but I suppose it could have the effect of showing some depth - maybe getting the car moving away down the road would have worked even better.  I''ll give it a 5 - interesting concept that could have been done better.</td>', 'You''re picture is *way* over compressed, which mars an otherwise interesting idea.  Your image is only 14k - it can be up to 150k.  Use as much of that space as you can.  Beyond that...  An interesting idea, pulled off reasonably well.  Normally, I''d say the moon was over-exposed, but it works for effect here.  The lights - that''s a tough call.  The fact that they aren''t straight bothers me at first, but I suppose it could have the effect of showing some depth - maybe getting the car moving away down the road would have worked even better.  I''ll give it a 5 - interesting concept that could have been done better.', '2003-09-17 02:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
