(421315, 37988, 9854, '<td valign="top">Striking and emotive. The soft focus is effective. It''s a shame that there are artifacts around some of the grains. Perhaps cleaning them with NeatImage would help?</td>', 'Striking and emotive. The soft focus is effective. It''s a shame that there are artifacts around some of the grains. Perhaps cleaning them with NeatImage would help?', '2003-09-17 04:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
