(421318, 38095, 10084, '<td valign="top">What a great idea. The composition gives great interest to the shot. The green really stands out. The focus is perfect. It really makes the subject pop out. "10"</td>', 'What a great idea. The composition gives great interest to the shot. The green really stands out. The focus is perfect. It really makes the subject pop out. "10"', '2003-09-17 04:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
