(421756, 38175, 772, '<td valign="top">Greetings :)  This is a particuarly strong photo in my opinion.  I think your interpretation of this challenge is a very emotive one.  These two hands in the darkness also seem to represent a strong bond between the parent and child... maybe also a ''comforting'' mood.  Who is giving the comfort?  The child or the adult?  :)  This is also a great example of how creative lighting can create emotion in a photo.  This is my favorite photo in this challenge... great work :) = 10</td>', 'Greetings :)  This is a particuarly strong photo in my opinion.  I think your interpretation of this challenge is a very emotive one.  These two hands in the darkness also seem to represent a strong bond between the parent and child... maybe also a ''comforting'' mood.  Who is giving the comfort?  The child or the adult?  :)  This is also a great example of how creative lighting can create emotion in a photo.  This is my favorite photo in this challenge... great work :) = 10', '2003-09-17 13:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
