(422277, 37959, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, some lovely expressions caught, but I''m having trouble deciding what to focus on. I feel I should follow the gazes of the two women, but I can''t because I can''t see the baby''s face. Great lighting and tones though. 6</td>', 'Nice idea, some lovely expressions caught, but I''m having trouble deciding what to focus on. I feel I should follow the gazes of the two women, but I can''t because I can''t see the baby''s face. Great lighting and tones though. 6', '2003-09-17 19:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
