(422284, 38090, 5677, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition.  The focus is wonderful.  The colors are very nice too, except that the left side of his face seems to have a greenish tint.</td>', 'Excellent composition.  The focus is wonderful.  The colors are very nice too, except that the left side of his face seems to have a greenish tint.', '2003-09-17 19:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(422286, 37785, 8522, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait, it''s a shame the background isn''t more photogenic though. I feel that there isn''t enough contrast between the dog and the background, and the stray compositional elements at the top (the grass and object at top left) detract from the shot. The woman''s skin tone seems a bit underexposed to me... I''d have been tempted to correct this with a curves adjustment in Photoshop. 6</td>', 'Lovely portrait, it''s a shame the background isn''t more photogenic though. I feel that there isn''t enough contrast between the dog and the background, and the stray compositional elements at the top (the grass and object at top left) detract from the shot. The woman''s skin tone seems a bit underexposed to me... I''d have been tempted to correct this with a curves adjustment in Photoshop. 6', '2003-09-17 19:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(422289, 38013, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wow, I could spend ages trying to get my head around that analogy. But I''ll stop before my head hurts. Interesting pic, but I think the composition lets it down. I can''t decide if your moon needs to be more centred, it''s placement doesn''t look deliberate. And I can''t decide if you were using the silhouetted trees as part of your composition. 6</td>', 'Wow, I could spend ages trying to get my head around that analogy. But I''ll stop before my head hurts. Interesting pic, but I think the composition lets it down. I can''t decide if your moon needs to be more centred, it''s placement doesn''t look deliberate. And I can''t decide if you were using the silhouetted trees as part of your composition. 6', '2003-09-17 19:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(422290, 38168, 5677, '<td valign="top">Nice shot using the rule of thirds.  The lighting gets a little harsh in the lower right corner, but still a great photo.</td>', 'Nice shot using the rule of thirds.  The lighting gets a little harsh in the lower right corner, but still a great photo.', '2003-09-17 19:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(422291, 37525, 8522, '<td valign="top">Adorable portrait, but doesn''t say anything profound about life to me, other than it''s messy. 5</td>', 'Adorable portrait, but doesn''t say anything profound about life to me, other than it''s messy. 5', '2003-09-17 19:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
