(422422, 37298, 4340, '<td valign="top">nice idea</td>', 'nice idea', '2003-09-17 21:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(422425, 37979, 12151, '<td valign="top">Caught the statue when the sun was right, and with the wind in her hair...</td>', 'Caught the statue when the sun was right, and with the wind in her hair...', '2003-09-17 21:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(422426, 38092, 12151, '<td valign="top">Great colors, but not sure how it applies to the theme...</td>', 'Great colors, but not sure how it applies to the theme...', '2003-09-17 21:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(422428, 37324, 1379, '<td valign="top">Oh my gosh... the expressions on these three are AWESOME!  I especially love the beatific, Mona Lisa smile of the flower girl in blue.  So much going on! I hope the wedding was glorious.</td>', 'Oh my gosh... the expressions on these three are AWESOME!  I especially love the beatific, Mona Lisa smile of the flower girl in blue.  So much going on! I hope the wedding was glorious.', '2003-09-17 21:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(422429, 37271, 7763, '<td valign="top">wow would have been great for the OOPS category<br/></td>', 'wow would have been great for the OOPS category', '2003-09-17 21:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(422432, 38162, 1379, '<td valign="top">I really enjoyed examining the details in this shot.  I love the way everything is partially obscured or cropped, with the exception of the wedding band...  The lonesome wedding band...  I''ve created an entire story inside my head about this shot.  Thanks!</td>', 'I really enjoyed examining the details in this shot.  I love the way everything is partially obscured or cropped, with the exception of the wedding band...  The lonesome wedding band...  I''ve created an entire story inside my head about this shot.  Thanks!', '2003-09-17 21:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(422433, 37503, 8522, '<td valign="top">I didn''t see the connection with life at first, but then I don''t have a bike!<br/>I can image that once you''re bitten by that bug, that your bike not only becomes ''life'', but is also a great analogy for it as well. This portrait is great, at first I thought it was a little blurry, but then if he prizes the bike more than himself, I can see why the focus is there. Great atmosphere evoked in the shot, very moody. Great use of b&amp;w. The hands are what makes this shot particularly effective. Nice use of light and shadow. 8 (I''d have given a 10 if I didn''t have to be so creative matching the shot to the challenge!).</td>', 'I didn''t see the connection with life at first, but then I don''t have a bike!I can image that once you''re bitten by that bug, that your bike not only becomes ''life'', but is also a great analogy for it as well. This portrait is great, at first I thought it was a little blurry, but then if he prizes the bike more than himself, I can see why the focus is there. Great atmosphere evoked in the shot, very moody. Great use of b&w. The hands are what makes this shot particularly effective. Nice use of light and shadow. 8 (I''d have given a 10 if I didn''t have to be so creative matching the shot to the challenge!).', '2003-09-17 21:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(422434, 37952, 1379, '<td valign="top">What a glorious little body of water!  That highly polished surface is incredible.  Great shot, and what a wonderful place.  I hope you enjoyed your visit to this vista.</td>', 'What a glorious little body of water!  That highly polished surface is incredible.  Great shot, and what a wonderful place.  I hope you enjoyed your visit to this vista.', '2003-09-17 21:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(422436, 38072, 1379, '<td valign="top">What a horrible life for this animal...  Your photo is incredible, with the blur and the harshness of the silver chain.  How sad.</td>', 'What a horrible life for this animal...  Your photo is incredible, with the blur and the harshness of the silver chain.  How sad.', '2003-09-17 22:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(422438, 38176, 10510, '<td valign="top">Could have been more centered but great concept for the challenge - life does end in death, but time goes on, so somewhere in belief, life is everlasting.  10</td>', 'Could have been more centered but great concept for the challenge - life does end in death, but time goes on, so somewhere in belief, life is everlasting.  10', '2003-09-17 22:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(422439, 37959, 10510, '<td valign="top">Great photo - beautiful people.</td>', 'Great photo - beautiful people.', '2003-09-17 22:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(422442, 38028, 10510, '<td valign="top">Did you teach him how to do that just for this photo?  Haha.  Great concept.  My life has seen this several times.</td>', 'Did you teach him how to do that just for this photo?  Haha.  Great concept.  My life has seen this several times.', '2003-09-17 22:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(422445, 37946, 4338, '<td valign="top">very sharp and clear,,,,,great job</td>', 'very sharp and clear,,,,,great job', '2003-09-17 22:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(422446, 38159, 10510, '<td valign="top">Oh, I want one.</td>', 'Oh, I want one.', '2003-09-17 22:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(422451, 37965, 10510, '<td valign="top">Too cute.  If you can do this, you have endless possibilities in the future.  10</td>', 'Too cute.  If you can do this, you have endless possibilities in the future.  10', '2003-09-17 22:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(422460, 37545, 9643, '<td valign="top">Congratulations and thanks for sharing a peek at this wonderful little miracle called Frankie.  He sure looks ready to take life on.</td>', 'Congratulations and thanks for sharing a peek at this wonderful little miracle called Frankie.  He sure looks ready to take life on.', '2003-09-17 22:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(422462, 37525, 10510, '<td valign="top">Too cute.</td>', 'Too cute.', '2003-09-17 22:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(422465, 38090, 327, '<td valign="top">These boys just keep growing! Kids so often have the weight of the world in their young eyes. This is a super good capture of a ''serious'' expression on such a young face.  Nice work, as always.</td>', 'These boys just keep growing! Kids so often have the weight of the world in their young eyes. This is a super good capture of a ''serious'' expression on such a young face.  Nice work, as always.', '2003-09-17 22:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(422467, 37577, 327, '<td valign="top">I like this photo. It''s different, strange and intriguing. I do think it''s dark..the trees. I see the heavy cloud cover and understand. Nice shot.</td>', 'I like this photo. It''s different, strange and intriguing. I do think it''s dark..the trees. I see the heavy cloud cover and understand. Nice shot.', '2003-09-17 22:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(422470, 37877, 10818, '<td valign="top">I sm</td>', 'I sm', '2003-09-17 22:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(422471, 37651, 327, '<td valign="top">Mesmerizing photo. I do think the saturation is a bit heavy, but it''s really nice.</td>', 'Mesmerizing photo. I do think the saturation is a bit heavy, but it''s really nice.', '2003-09-17 22:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(422472, 38081, 327, '<td valign="top">Unusual shot, and mesmerizing. Nice work.</td>', 'Unusual shot, and mesmerizing. Nice work.', '2003-09-17 22:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(422475, 38066, 327, '<td valign="top">These people have so little. This could be a shot in Time Magazine. Just a bit oof and lots of grain. Still I love seeing this, thanks for posting.</td>', 'These people have so little. This could be a shot in Time Magazine. Just a bit oof and lots of grain. Still I love seeing this, thanks for posting.', '2003-09-17 22:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(422477, 38087, 327, '<td valign="top">Sure they do! Big ones/little ones they all have feelings. I think you really captured his emotions here. Maybe a bit too much light on the face but the shot is interesting and for the most part it''s good. Nice shooting.</td>', 'Sure they do! Big ones/little ones they all have feelings. I think you really captured his emotions here. Maybe a bit too much light on the face but the shot is interesting and for the most part it''s good. Nice shooting.', '2003-09-17 22:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(422478, 38130, 7763, '<td valign="top">Thanks for making me smile:)</td>', 'Thanks for making me smile:)', '2003-09-17 22:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(422479, 38000, 10818, '<td valign="top">Bad picture, and a worse concept.</td>', 'Bad picture, and a worse concept.', '2003-09-17 22:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(422480, 37754, 327, '<td valign="top">Very bright light (sun). The colors are very nice as is the composition. Well done.</td>', 'Very bright light (sun). The colors are very nice as is the composition. Well done.', '2003-09-17 22:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(422484, 37779, 327, '<td valign="top">Love your humor.....</td>', 'Love your humor.....', '2003-09-17 22:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(422486, 37502, 327, '<td valign="top">Lots of grain and moir pattern, but this is still a very interesting, intriguing shot.</td>', 'Lots of grain and moir pattern, but this is still a very interesting, intriguing shot.', '2003-09-17 22:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(422487, 37387, 327, '<td valign="top">Bet he''s got a few tales to tell. His face is a bit dark and your a bit far from him. Still I find this interesting to see. Nice shootin.</td>', 'Bet he''s got a few tales to tell. His face is a bit dark and your a bit far from him. Still I find this interesting to see. Nice shootin.', '2003-09-17 23:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(422489, 38080, 327, '<td valign="top">Vivid colors, lovely to look at. It might of been improved by cropping the top dark clouds and adding more of the horizon. Nice shooting.</td>', 'Vivid colors, lovely to look at. It might of been improved by cropping the top dark clouds and adding more of the horizon. Nice shooting.', '2003-09-17 23:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
