(422773, 37360, 7263, '<td valign="top">nice image, shame about the random head at the foot of the image</td>', 'nice image, shame about the random head at the foot of the image', '2003-09-18 05:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(422775, 37927, 7263, '<td valign="top">great image, love the skin tones they are spot on. expressions are great too. Varied faces, and varied haircuts (kind of worthy of a gap ad). the chap on the right could do with being a bit tighetr like the rest is my only negative on this image.<br/> <br/>However, the border to me ruins this, sorry but it does affect this otherwsie 10 photograph.  a 4 frame border this thick starts to attract the eye off the photograph. It doesn''t compliment it like say a gold frame woudl a pice of art.<br/> <br/>Am scoring an 8. but without the frame a 10 i think.<br/> <br/>You are obviously a good photographer, and this image made me look a bit longer than most.<br/> <br/></td>', 'great image, love the skin tones they are spot on. expressions are great too. Varied faces, and varied haircuts (kind of worthy of a gap ad). the chap on the right could do with being a bit tighetr like the rest is my only negative on this image. However, the border to me ruins this, sorry but it does affect this otherwsie 10 photograph.  a 4 frame border this thick starts to attract the eye off the photograph. It doesn''t compliment it like say a gold frame woudl a pice of art. Am scoring an 8. but without the frame a 10 i think. You are obviously a good photographer, and this image made me look a bit longer than most. ', '2003-09-18 05:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(422777, 37919, 7263, '<td valign="top">interesting shot, but a little over-lit.</td>', 'interesting shot, but a little over-lit.', '2003-09-18 05:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(422778, 38053, 7263, '<td valign="top">harrowing! woudl crop 30% off the top to enhance this imge</td>', 'harrowing! woudl crop 30% off the top to enhance this imge', '2003-09-18 05:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(422779, 37295, 7263, '<td valign="top">Oh my god, the second great image I have seen in the last hour, and the second which has the worlds most awful border. Sorry, but this border is rank. It''s way too thick, it''s un even, it''s colours don''t compliment the image.<br/> <br/>The image, is perfect (maybe a little bit out of focus) the red shirt really draws the eye, and the leading lines enhance that too. The subject has feeling and a certain warmth, even though it looks cold?!?<br/> <br/>woudl be a 10, but an 8 becasue of the border. Nice image and good eye.</td>', 'Oh my god, the second great image I have seen in the last hour, and the second which has the worlds most awful border. Sorry, but this border is rank. It''s way too thick, it''s un even, it''s colours don''t compliment the image. The image, is perfect (maybe a little bit out of focus) the red shirt really draws the eye, and the leading lines enhance that too. The subject has feeling and a certain warmth, even though it looks cold?!? woudl be a 10, but an 8 becasue of the border. Nice image and good eye.', '2003-09-18 05:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(422780, 38082, 7263, '<td valign="top">super shot. nice to see someone recommended thsi for DQ but got it wrong! haha.<br/> <br/>I feel a 10 is worthy. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'super shot. nice to see someone recommended thsi for DQ but got it wrong! haha. I feel a 10 is worthy. Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-09-18 05:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(422781, 37980, 7263, '<td valign="top">i detest cat and dog images ;) but you have captured something most others don''t. Colours all compliment eachother too.</td>', 'i detest cat and dog images ;) but you have captured something most others don''t. Colours all compliment eachother too.', '2003-09-18 05:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(422782, 38158, 7263, '<td valign="top">was so good - a 10 until I saw the middle. a bit too much white. nice photograph still 7!</td>', 'was so good - a 10 until I saw the middle. a bit too much white. nice photograph still 7!', '2003-09-18 05:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(422783, 37264, 7263, '<td valign="top">lovely image. 9!</td>', 'lovely image. 9!', '2003-09-18 05:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
