(422788, 38014, 7263, '<td valign="top">great title and shot. Good composition, teh bee almost looks like he is sitting down having a break ;) Border is a bit naff ;(</td>', 'great title and shot. Good composition, teh bee almost looks like he is sitting down having a break ;) Border is a bit naff ;(', '2003-09-18 05:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(422789, 37695, 7263, '<td valign="top">mmmm, i can taste it from here! Real shame the cake is so out of focus. but the ligting is superb!  Also nice to see, after 100+ photos, the first person to include a tastefull complimenting border - 2 extra marks for that alone. <br/> <br/>Ps: the man looks like the chap from Dawsons Creek. Pacy ;)<br/> <br/>9!</td>', 'mmmm, i can taste it from here! Real shame the cake is so out of focus. but the ligting is superb!  Also nice to see, after 100+ photos, the first person to include a tastefull complimenting border - 2 extra marks for that alone.  Ps: the man looks like the chap from Dawsons Creek. Pacy ;) 9!', '2003-09-18 05:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
