(422821, 38095, 8522, '<td valign="top">I feel that the stones(?) are too warm a colour for this shot to really impact. I hope you don''t mind but I had a quick experiment with this photo by desaturating everything but the shoot, and then adjusting the colour balance to provide more blue in the highlights and shadows, and a touch more cyan and blue in the mids. This then needs NeatImage to remove the noise. To my taste this then packs a lot more punch, emphasising the vibrant shoot coming through the inert, lifeless stones. This is all DPC legal. Other than that, it''s a great shot! 8</td>', 'I feel that the stones(?) are too warm a colour for this shot to really impact. I hope you don''t mind but I had a quick experiment with this photo by desaturating everything but the shoot, and then adjusting the colour balance to provide more blue in the highlights and shadows, and a touch more cyan and blue in the mids. This then needs NeatImage to remove the noise. To my taste this then packs a lot more punch, emphasising the vibrant shoot coming through the inert, lifeless stones. This is all DPC legal. Other than that, it''s a great shot! 8', '2003-09-18 09:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(422822, 38105, 4615, '<td valign="top">This is very well done.  Compelling, andthe light is beautiful</td>', 'This is very well done.  Compelling, andthe light is beautiful', '2003-09-18 09:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
