(423565, 37696, 6405, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of Kansas or Eastern Colorado!,10 from me!</td>', 'Reminds me of Kansas or Eastern Colorado!,10 from me!', '2003-09-18 22:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(423589, 37774, 9643, '<td valign="top">I like everything about this picture.  The great focus on the face of the dog, the wonderful capture of his motion, the movement from light on the bottom to dark on the top, the "human" partner in boots, and the title.  It made me sit right up so I guess it has "wow" - at least for me.</td>', 'I like everything about this picture.  The great focus on the face of the dog, the wonderful capture of his motion, the movement from light on the bottom to dark on the top, the "human" partner in boots, and the title.  It made me sit right up so I guess it has "wow" - at least for me.', '2003-09-18 22:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(423596, 37618, 11738, '<td valign="top">Either ths guy is a tense sleeper, or he''s faking it.  Muscles around eyes and mouth don''t seem right for someone who is dozing.  I like the hair.  It''s very natural and the lighting is very good.  Pretty good shot.</td>', 'Either ths guy is a tense sleeper, or he''s faking it.  Muscles around eyes and mouth don''t seem right for someone who is dozing.  I like the hair.  It''s very natural and the lighting is very good.  Pretty good shot.', '2003-09-18 22:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(423598, 37264, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I would have taken this shot in a prone or kneeling position to be closer to the path/road and thus put more emphasis on it.  I''m glad you had such a beautiful day to take this shot.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I would have taken this shot in a prone or kneeling position to be closer to the path/road and thus put more emphasis on it.  I''m glad you had such a beautiful day to take this shot.', '2003-09-18 22:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(423599, 37779, 11738, '<td valign="top">LOL.  Love it!  Fluffy takes revenge!</td>', 'LOL.  Love it!  Fluffy takes revenge!', '2003-09-18 22:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(423602, 38101, 11738, '<td valign="top">I''ve been staring at this for a few minutes and I still can''t figure out what it is.  By the title I''m assuming that the central bright part is a lit TV.  Interesting abstract shot though.</td>', 'I''ve been staring at this for a few minutes and I still can''t figure out what it is.  By the title I''m assuming that the central bright part is a lit TV.  Interesting abstract shot though.', '2003-09-18 22:48:08.000000', NULL, 1);
