(424245, 37295, 6900, '<td valign="top">This border...is hideous.  What were you thinking? LoL  The pic itself is great.  I think you did it a huge disservice.</td>', 'This border...is hideous.  What were you thinking? LoL  The pic itself is great.  I think you did it a huge disservice.', '2003-09-19 18:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
