(424331, 37803, 11111, '<td valign="top">I just love this shot! You say so much here without cluttering the image! I like your choice of tone as well.</td>', 'I just love this shot! You say so much here without cluttering the image! I like your choice of tone as well.', '2003-09-19 22:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(424333, 37545, 11111, '<td valign="top">How sweet! Beautiful boy! You\''re sure to have a wonderful life with this cutie. The expression on his face looks so uncertain, just as it should to a tiny tot.</td>', 'How sweet! Beautiful boy! You\''re sure to have a wonderful life with this cutie. The expression on his face looks so uncertain, just as it should to a tiny tot.', '2003-09-19 22:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(424334, 37473, 11111, '<td valign="top">Wow! This is so sharp. Is the lizard really real. Nice composition and lighting. I can''t think of a thing to improve it, for my tastes.</td>', 'Wow! This is so sharp. Is the lizard really real. Nice composition and lighting. I can''t think of a thing to improve it, for my tastes.', '2003-09-19 22:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(424336, 37861, 11111, '<td valign="top">I like the different layers you draw the eye through here. Nice shot!</td>', 'I like the different layers you draw the eye through here. Nice shot!', '2003-09-19 22:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(424337, 37658, 11111, '<td valign="top">How frustratingly true! This shot holds my interest and makes me wonder what she''s waiting for, as well as what she looks like! Great subject.</td>', 'How frustratingly true! This shot holds my interest and makes me wonder what she''s waiting for, as well as what she looks like! Great subject.', '2003-09-19 22:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(424338, 38053, 11800, '<td valign="top">Cool</td>', 'Cool', '2003-09-19 22:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(424339, 37583, 11111, '<td valign="top">Awesome - love this! Wonderful on so many levels and technically so, too!</td>', 'Awesome - love this! Wonderful on so many levels and technically so, too!', '2003-09-19 22:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(424341, 37946, 11111, '<td valign="top">I love this image. You really convey a sense of fun here! Great color and so sharp!</td>', 'I love this image. You really convey a sense of fun here! Great color and so sharp!', '2003-09-19 22:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(424342, 37974, 11111, '<td valign="top">This toad is quite a find, but I don''t know that he appears confused. I think a larger sized image would help your shot.</td>', 'This toad is quite a find, but I don''t know that he appears confused. I think a larger sized image would help your shot.', '2003-09-19 22:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(424344, 38132, 11111, '<td valign="top">What drama! Wonderful! Very crisp b&amp;w. Nice job here!</td>', 'What drama! Wonderful! Very crisp b&w. Nice job here!', '2003-09-19 22:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(424346, 37636, 11111, '<td valign="top">Shiva looks just a little overexposed and blurred. This is an interesting and creative shot you have here though. Nice job capturing the cosmic energy rays!</td>', 'Shiva looks just a little overexposed and blurred. This is an interesting and creative shot you have here though. Nice job capturing the cosmic energy rays!', '2003-09-19 22:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(424347, 37619, 11111, '<td valign="top">Looks like he''s really clipping along here. Weird! It holds my interest and is definitely unique. Great bright color and deep texture as well!</td>', 'Looks like he''s really clipping along here. Weird! It holds my interest and is definitely unique. Great bright color and deep texture as well!', '2003-09-19 22:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(424348, 38082, 11800, '<td valign="top">OH good, I forsee another "how''d they do that" segment coming up.  How''d you get the wood to be gray?</td>', 'OH good, I forsee another "how''d they do that" segment coming up.  How''d you get the wood to be gray?', '2003-09-19 22:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(424349, 38114, 11111, '<td valign="top">Wonderful! Great sense of humor. You caught the expression well. Good composition, light, and emotion.</td>', 'Wonderful! Great sense of humor. You caught the expression well. Good composition, light, and emotion.', '2003-09-19 22:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(424351, 37290, 11111, '<td valign="top">Good response to the challenge. I like the choice of b&amp;w! My eye is drawn more to the center of the photo though, rather than to kid or life subject here, because the kid is slightly out of focus while the other swing''s chain, in the center, seems perfectly IN focus.</td>', 'Good response to the challenge. I like the choice of b&w! My eye is drawn more to the center of the photo though, rather than to kid or life subject here, because the kid is slightly out of focus while the other swing''s chain, in the center, seems perfectly IN focus.', '2003-09-19 22:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(424353, 37714, 11111, '<td valign="top">I love this one! Title says it all. Your choice of composition even helps me visualize what lies outside the frame.</td>', 'I love this one! Title says it all. Your choice of composition even helps me visualize what lies outside the frame.', '2003-09-19 22:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(424355, 38131, 11111, '<td valign="top">Good metaphor in the title. Original idea. Really nice detail in your photo.</td>', 'Good metaphor in the title. Original idea. Really nice detail in your photo.', '2003-09-19 22:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(424357, 37631, 11111, '<td valign="top">Great color. Butterfly looks slightly out of focus. Beautiful flowers.</td>', 'Great color. Butterfly looks slightly out of focus. Beautiful flowers.', '2003-09-19 22:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(424359, 37720, 11111, '<td valign="top">I love your idea here. What luck to have run across this scenery! Beautiful composition. Great detail in the rocky surrounding.</td>', 'I love your idea here. What luck to have run across this scenery! Beautiful composition. Great detail in the rocky surrounding.', '2003-09-19 22:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(424361, 37271, 11111, '<td valign="top">Wow! Great capture of motion. This must have been tough to pull off. I really like the background and choice of subject as well as the framing of Sue. Certainly original. Flash seems a bit strong though.</td>', 'Wow! Great capture of motion. This must have been tough to pull off. I really like the background and choice of subject as well as the framing of Sue. Certainly original. Flash seems a bit strong though.', '2003-09-19 22:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(424366, 37979, 11111, '<td valign="top">Good choice using b&amp;w here. At first I found this disturbing and not very lifelike at all, but once I looked again I found your image arresting. You''ve done a great job capturing a fact of REAL life - unfortunately mothers must spend a considerable amount of time protecting their children these days. Sharp, well exposed.</td>', 'Good choice using b&w here. At first I found this disturbing and not very lifelike at all, but once I looked again I found your image arresting. You''ve done a great job capturing a fact of REAL life - unfortunately mothers must spend a considerable amount of time protecting their children these days. Sharp, well exposed.', '2003-09-19 22:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(424370, 37346, 11111, '<td valign="top">Good idea here. Seems a little blurry though. If you cropped out the top part of the image and left side with the cleaning person it might help the eye focus more on the soldiers. It does take guts to take a shot like this.</td>', 'Good idea here. Seems a little blurry though. If you cropped out the top part of the image and left side with the cleaning person it might help the eye focus more on the soldiers. It does take guts to take a shot like this.', '2003-09-19 22:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(424371, 38183, 11111, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color and reflections in the pool. Top center light source looks a little overexposed.</td>', 'Beautiful color and reflections in the pool. Top center light source looks a little overexposed.', '2003-09-19 22:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(424374, 37434, 11111, '<td valign="top">This looks so slick and liquid-y, the way slippery newborns really are. Looks a bit out of focus and somewhat cartoonish though. Good composition under difficult conditions!</td>', 'This looks so slick and liquid-y, the way slippery newborns really are. Looks a bit out of focus and somewhat cartoonish though. Good composition under difficult conditions!', '2003-09-19 22:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(424375, 38176, 11800, '<td valign="top">This is the best visualization of the theme. I''ll give you a ten for the concept.</td>', 'This is the best visualization of the theme. I''ll give you a ten for the concept.', '2003-09-19 22:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(424377, 37295, 11111, '<td valign="top">Charming! Great colors. Very balanced shot. Looks slightly out of focus.</td>', 'Charming! Great colors. Very balanced shot. Looks slightly out of focus.', '2003-09-19 22:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(424378, 37963, 11111, '<td valign="top">Wonderful bright colors. Interesting cornucopia with the strainer - creative! Lighting appears a bit too harsh fo rmy taste. Would be nice to see some gentle shadows.</td>', 'Wonderful bright colors. Interesting cornucopia with the strainer - creative! Lighting appears a bit too harsh fo rmy taste. Would be nice to see some gentle shadows.', '2003-09-19 22:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(424379, 37779, 11111, '<td valign="top">You must be some kind of goofball! Creative shot. Good sense of humo. That''s important in life!  A little over exposed at top near guy''s head and under exposed around dog. Would like to see more greys here. Funny just the same.</td>', 'You must be some kind of goofball! Creative shot. Good sense of humo. That''s important in life!  A little over exposed at top near guy''s head and under exposed around dog. Would like to see more greys here. Funny just the same.', '2003-09-19 22:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(424380, 37324, 11111, '<td valign="top">Certainly fits the challenge topic! Interesting and candid.</td>', 'Certainly fits the challenge topic! Interesting and candid.', '2003-09-19 22:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(424383, 38078, 11111, '<td valign="top">Aw. This conveys a lot of emotion. It''s so much more than a snapshot of a kid and dog. Nice colors going on here!  Perfect composition.</td>', 'Aw. This conveys a lot of emotion. It''s so much more than a snapshot of a kid and dog. Nice colors going on here!  Perfect composition.', '2003-09-19 22:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(424384, 37896, 11111, '<td valign="top">Good title! Nicely composed shot.</td>', 'Good title! Nicely composed shot.', '2003-09-19 22:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(424386, 38125, 11111, '<td valign="top">Great title! Strong depiction of your emotion here. Very striking and memorable.</td>', 'Great title! Strong depiction of your emotion here. Very striking and memorable.', '2003-09-19 22:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(424388, 38076, 2200, '<td valign="top">Is that Donald?</td>', 'Is that Donald?', '2003-09-19 23:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(424389, 37747, 11111, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous capture of this guy. The background is beautiful as well. Composition is perfect. So sharp, too.</td>', 'Gorgeous capture of this guy. The background is beautiful as well. Composition is perfect. So sharp, too.', '2003-09-19 23:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(424390, 38152, 11111, '<td valign="top">Such a wonderful shot of new life. If you know anything about babies!!! I can almost feel that new waxy skin and the nails haven''t even been trimmed yet. This is a keeper for sure. Lovely.</td>', 'Such a wonderful shot of new life. If you know anything about babies!!! I can almost feel that new waxy skin and the nails haven''t even been trimmed yet. This is a keeper for sure. Lovely.', '2003-09-19 23:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(424393, 38074, 11111, '<td valign="top">Sweet shot conveys a lot of emotion. Great lighting toward the back of the baby, but the dark green blanket seems to swallow up a lot of it. I think a tighter crop that eliminates most of the woman''s hand except for the ring finger would help make this a stronger shot.</td>', 'Sweet shot conveys a lot of emotion. Great lighting toward the back of the baby, but the dark green blanket seems to swallow up a lot of it. I think a tighter crop that eliminates most of the woman''s hand except for the ring finger would help make this a stronger shot.', '2003-09-19 23:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(424399, 37988, 11111, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. I just love this photo! I want to be her right now! Wonderful lighting and perfect dramatic focus. Unique and delightful! Looks like the perfect day to me.</td>', 'Beautiful. I just love this photo! I want to be her right now! Wonderful lighting and perfect dramatic focus. Unique and delightful! Looks like the perfect day to me.', '2003-09-19 23:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(424404, 37298, 11111, '<td valign="top">Very unique shot. Think cropping out the guard rail, if possible, would make this a stronger shot. Very nice detail and color! The little twig at the center left is distracting. Overall a pleasant shot! Memorable, too.</td>', 'Very unique shot. Think cropping out the guard rail, if possible, would make this a stronger shot. Very nice detail and color! The little twig at the center left is distracting. Overall a pleasant shot! Memorable, too.', '2003-09-19 23:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(424405, 38167, 11111, '<td valign="top">Good composition. Interesting textures throughout.</td>', 'Good composition. Interesting textures throughout.', '2003-09-19 23:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(424408, 38151, 11111, '<td valign="top">Dizzying effect that most puzzles have on me at first. How creative this is!</td>', 'Dizzying effect that most puzzles have on me at first. How creative this is!', '2003-09-19 23:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(424411, 37577, 11111, '<td valign="top">Very cool! Perfect composition. Love the neutral colors. GReat idea.</td>', 'Very cool! Perfect composition. Love the neutral colors. GReat idea.', '2003-09-19 23:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(424415, 37805, 11111, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors here. Such balanced composition. too. Very nice.</td>', 'Beautiful colors here. Such balanced composition. too. Very nice.', '2003-09-19 23:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(424418, 38016, 11111, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Depending on what your intention is here, could use greater depth of field to get those white pieces on the board in focus. Guitar seems out of place, but if it means something to this scene that I just don''t get, that''s fine. I guess there are too many objects here for my taste. Nice, deep, blacks and whites though. Lighting is very well done.</td>', 'Interesting. Depending on what your intention is here, could use greater depth of field to get those white pieces on the board in focus. Guitar seems out of place, but if it means something to this scene that I just don''t get, that''s fine. I guess there are too many objects here for my taste. Nice, deep, blacks and whites though. Lighting is very well done.', '2003-09-19 23:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(424420, 37498, 11800, '<td valign="top">No one is looking in the same direction or at each other. Looks way too posed.</td>', 'No one is looking in the same direction or at each other. Looks way too posed.', '2003-09-19 23:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(424421, 38166, 11111, '<td valign="top">Hilarious! Wonderful expression and color gets your point across. You look crazy - but that''s good here!!! Background is a bit distracting and blends into the hair. Lighting a bit harsh coming through that window over the right shoulder. I like this photo though!</td>', 'Hilarious! Wonderful expression and color gets your point across. You look crazy - but that''s good here!!! Background is a bit distracting and blends into the hair. Lighting a bit harsh coming through that window over the right shoulder. I like this photo though!', '2003-09-19 23:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(424422, 37878, 11111, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the border does anything for this shot. It''s very nice on it''s own. I like the composition quite a lot. Color seems perfect for the feeling.</td>', 'I don''t think the border does anything for this shot. It''s very nice on it''s own. I like the composition quite a lot. Color seems perfect for the feeling.', '2003-09-19 23:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(424423, 37739, 11111, '<td valign="top">Good sense of humor. Good composition, lighting, etc. Great choppers!</td>', 'Good sense of humor. Good composition, lighting, etc. Great choppers!', '2003-09-19 23:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(424424, 37918, 11111, '<td valign="top">I like the composition here and sense of wonder created by the girl looking into the sky. The shot itself seems a bit pixelated and oversharpened. A color shot may have helped this convey a stronger sense from your title as well.</td>', 'I like the composition here and sense of wonder created by the girl looking into the sky. The shot itself seems a bit pixelated and oversharpened. A color shot may have helped this convey a stronger sense from your title as well.', '2003-09-19 23:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(424425, 37912, 11111, '<td valign="top">Love this composition! Looks like more of the focus is on the tree rather than the moss, though. Maybe it''s that great big eye. Nice shot.</td>', 'Love this composition! Looks like more of the focus is on the tree rather than the moss, though. Maybe it''s that great big eye. Nice shot.', '2003-09-19 23:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(424427, 38154, 2716, '<td valign="top">Super shot.  I really like the sof warm colors and the nice silhouette.  One of my farvorites so far.  10</td>', 'Super shot.  I really like the sof warm colors and the nice silhouette.  One of my farvorites so far.  10', '2003-09-19 23:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(424429, 37718, 11111, '<td valign="top">This is a nice, soft, emotional photo. I find myself straining to see what ''s in the background behind the baby''s hand though. Is it your other hand or his body? Very nice b&amp;w.</td>', 'This is a nice, soft, emotional photo. I find myself straining to see what ''s in the background behind the baby''s hand though. Is it your other hand or his body? Very nice b&w.', '2003-09-19 23:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(424430, 37583, 2716, '<td valign="top">lol the Game of Life.  thanks for the memories.  Nice concept.  Jacko.  8</td>', 'lol the Game of Life.  thanks for the memories.  Nice concept.  Jacko.  8', '2003-09-19 23:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(424433, 38176, 11111, '<td valign="top">Unique idea! I like your photo a lot, but my eye is drawn to the bare bit at the right  where the sign just ends. Cropping this so that there''s more focus on the clock and sign would make it a stronger shot, for my taste. Hope this helps. Just the same, am very glad I got to see this.</td>', 'Unique idea! I like your photo a lot, but my eye is drawn to the bare bit at the right  where the sign just ends. Cropping this so that there''s more focus on the clock and sign would make it a stronger shot, for my taste. Hope this helps. Just the same, am very glad I got to see this.', '2003-09-19 23:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(424434, 38036, 11111, '<td valign="top">Very striking colors and composition! Love it.</td>', 'Very striking colors and composition! Love it.', '2003-09-19 23:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(424436, 37798, 11111, '<td valign="top">Good catch! Focus looks a tiny bit soft. Very nice shot!</td>', 'Good catch! Focus looks a tiny bit soft. Very nice shot!', '2003-09-19 23:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(424437, 38184, 11111, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot of friends, indeed! Birdhouse poking out of girl''s hair is a little distracting, though. Fun shot!</td>', 'This is a great shot of friends, indeed! Birdhouse poking out of girl''s hair is a little distracting, though. Fun shot!', '2003-09-19 23:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(424438, 37250, 11111, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color. Focus seems a little too soft.</td>', 'Beautiful color. Focus seems a little too soft.', '2003-09-19 23:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(424439, 37939, 11111, '<td valign="top">Neat perspective!</td>', 'Neat perspective!', '2003-09-19 23:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(424440, 38132, 117, '<td valign="top">I don''t but I like it great work with the llighting</td>', 'I don''t but I like it great work with the llighting', '2003-09-19 23:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(424441, 37804, 11111, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what the blue thing is, but the cigarette near the kid sure is disturbing! Is it a balloon? Can''t tell from the angle. I don''t think I understand the title either, so there''s a connection I''m missing here. Overall, exposure seems good and it''s sharply focused.</td>', 'I don''t know what the blue thing is, but the cigarette near the kid sure is disturbing! Is it a balloon? Can''t tell from the angle. I don''t think I understand the title either, so there''s a connection I''m missing here. Overall, exposure seems good and it''s sharply focused.', '2003-09-19 23:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(424442, 37998, 11111, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color! The woman''s face and stance look too bored and staged to be carefree though. Her hair looks carefree! The background, on the otherhand, is fabulous and definitely conveys the carefree feeling!</td>', 'Beautiful color! The woman''s face and stance look too bored and staged to be carefree though. Her hair looks carefree! The background, on the otherhand, is fabulous and definitely conveys the carefree feeling!', '2003-09-19 23:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(424443, 38065, 11111, '<td valign="top">wonderful skin color and texture. fabulous expression! perfect composition and exposure.</td>', 'wonderful skin color and texture. fabulous expression! perfect composition and exposure.', '2003-09-19 23:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(424444, 38000, 11111, '<td valign="top">I do like the strong statement you''re making here. The photo looks too grainy and washed out though. The lighting is very harsh as well.</td>', 'I do like the strong statement you''re making here. The photo looks too grainy and washed out though. The lighting is very harsh as well.', '2003-09-19 23:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(424445, 38178, 11111, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Unique composition.</td>', 'Beautiful! Unique composition.', '2003-09-19 23:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(424446, 37525, 11111, '<td valign="top">Wonderful, carefree shot. Great emotion here! Look spontaneous to me. I love it!</td>', 'Wonderful, carefree shot. Great emotion here! Look spontaneous to me. I love it!', '2003-09-20 00:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(424448, 37849, 11111, '<td valign="top">Good lighting, sharp focus. I like the whole composition.</td>', 'Good lighting, sharp focus. I like the whole composition.', '2003-09-20 00:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(424449, 37767, 11111, '<td valign="top">Yuck-eee! Great shot! Love the way you chose to compose the image with boxes. Also, wonderful and simple.</td>', 'Yuck-eee! Great shot! Love the way you chose to compose the image with boxes. Also, wonderful and simple.', '2003-09-20 00:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(424450, 37757, 11111, '<td valign="top">Strange portrait. Good exposure and great colors. The shadow and wrinkle in the background are distracting and make me focus my attention there though.</td>', 'Strange portrait. Good exposure and great colors. The shadow and wrinkle in the background are distracting and make me focus my attention there though.', '2003-09-20 00:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(424452, 38082, 11111, '<td valign="top">Very neat! Super striking! Original and wonderful. It''s obvious you know what you''re doing here, so be sure to leave helpful comments for others. :)</td>', 'Very neat! Super striking! Original and wonderful. It''s obvious you know what you''re doing here, so be sure to leave helpful comments for others. :)', '2003-09-20 00:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(424453, 38040, 11111, '<td valign="top">Ha!!!! A wonderful, humorous photo! LOVE IT!</td>', 'Ha!!!! A wonderful, humorous photo! LOVE IT!', '2003-09-20 00:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(424454, 37965, 11111, '<td valign="top">Very cute portrait. Nicely framed and has good soft, pale colors. Seems a little washed out and overexposed.</td>', 'Very cute portrait. Nicely framed and has good soft, pale colors. Seems a little washed out and overexposed.', '2003-09-20 00:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(424455, 38170, 11111, '<td valign="top">Great kid photo! This really conveys life with all those smiling faces. Great composition and wonderful colors!</td>', 'Great kid photo! This really conveys life with all those smiling faces. Great composition and wonderful colors!', '2003-09-20 00:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(424457, 38175, 11111, '<td valign="top">Excellent b&amp;w. Love the composition, it''s so creative!</td>', 'Excellent b&w. Love the composition, it''s so creative!', '2003-09-20 00:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(424458, 37897, 11111, '<td valign="top">I like the child''s expression and it''s nicely done in b&amp;w. The photo in general seems too grainy though.</td>', 'I like the child''s expression and it''s nicely done in b&w. The photo in general seems too grainy though.', '2003-09-20 00:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(424461, 38187, 11111, '<td valign="top">This, in all aspects, is a very nice photo but I think the subject you chose is a stretch for this challenge.</td>', 'This, in all aspects, is a very nice photo but I think the subject you chose is a stretch for this challenge.', '2003-09-20 00:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(424464, 38092, 11111, '<td valign="top">This is a really good abstract. It''s too over-processed for my personal taste, but I admire the way you pulled these objects together.</td>', 'This is a really good abstract. It''s too over-processed for my personal taste, but I admire the way you pulled these objects together.', '2003-09-20 00:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(424466, 38079, 11111, '<td valign="top">Original!! The reflection on the glass and bits of stuff beneath it are a little distracting. Nice, sharp photo.</td>', 'Original!! The reflection on the glass and bits of stuff beneath it are a little distracting. Nice, sharp photo.', '2003-09-20 00:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(424467, 37421, 11111, '<td valign="top">oh my! i nearly submitted this exact photo. you did it much better than i could''ve though. of COURSE, i love your idea here! very well executed with perfect composition, toning, exposure. all that.</td>', 'oh my! i nearly submitted this exact photo. you did it much better than i could''ve though. of COURSE, i love your idea here! very well executed with perfect composition, toning, exposure. all that.', '2003-09-20 00:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(424468, 38135, 11111, '<td valign="top">congrats! a well composed, sharply focused baby boy! very nice shot. you convey that baby-softness nicely.</td>', 'congrats! a well composed, sharply focused baby boy! very nice shot. you convey that baby-softness nicely.', '2003-09-20 00:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(424470, 38173, 11111, '<td valign="top">this is so striking and i just love the colors here. unique perspective as well.</td>', 'this is so striking and i just love the colors here. unique perspective as well.', '2003-09-20 00:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(424471, 38154, 10414, '<td valign="top">Awesome!!!  The best one yet!!!!   10</td>', 'Awesome!!!  The best one yet!!!!   10', '2003-09-20 00:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
