(424475, 37545, 9168, '<td valign="top">Frankie is cute, but a little off center.</td>', 'Frankie is cute, but a little off center.', '2003-09-20 00:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(424476, 38170, 10260, '<td valign="top">Oh, I love this one.  It represents life in the fullest sense.  You''ve captured their sweet faces overflowing with the joy of life. 10</td>', 'Oh, I love this one.  It represents life in the fullest sense.  You''ve captured their sweet faces overflowing with the joy of life. 10', '2003-09-20 00:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(424478, 37785, 10260, '<td valign="top">Great photo.  Nice and clear and the face of the human is so expressive. :) Well, both faces are, actually.</td>', 'Great photo.  Nice and clear and the face of the human is so expressive. :) Well, both faces are, actually.', '2003-09-20 00:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(424480, 38145, 10260, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo. Macro is incredible to me.</td>', 'Beautiful photo. Macro is incredible to me.', '2003-09-20 00:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(424481, 38178, 9168, '<td valign="top">This is exactly what I had in mind.  Might have been better as a black and white.</td>', 'This is exactly what I had in mind.  Might have been better as a black and white.', '2003-09-20 00:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(424482, 38090, 10260, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo and beautiful subject.   This fits the challenge perfectly. I lie the border you''ve done also.</td>', 'Beautiful photo and beautiful subject.   This fits the challenge perfectly. I lie the border you''ve done also.', '2003-09-20 00:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(424483, 37682, 9168, '<td valign="top">Good but too much noise.</td>', 'Good but too much noise.', '2003-09-20 00:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(424484, 37877, 9168, '<td valign="top">ok, this is funny.</td>', 'ok, this is funny.', '2003-09-20 00:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(424486, 38082, 9168, '<td valign="top">I think this is pretty cool.  Very creative.</td>', 'I think this is pretty cool.  Very creative.', '2003-09-20 00:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(424487, 38000, 10260, '<td valign="top">Not mine, and I''m American.</td>', 'Not mine, and I''m American.', '2003-09-20 00:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(424488, 37498, 11111, '<td valign="top">very nicely composed and great focus! perfect in every way... but their faces... can they even stand being near each other? are those sardonic smiles i''m seeing?! i just can''t tell from the title, but because it''s the life challenge makes me thinks this is serious. this proves that anything can be interpreted in any way depending on your life''s experience. guess i have a different take on this because i always hated preppy, popular kids with fake smiles. still do at my old age. no offense, if these are your friends, but you''ve really stopped me in my tracks here!  don''t worry, high rating!</td>', 'very nicely composed and great focus! perfect in every way... but their faces... can they even stand being near each other? are those sardonic smiles i''m seeing?! i just can''t tell from the title, but because it''s the life challenge makes me thinks this is serious. this proves that anything can be interpreted in any way depending on your life''s experience. guess i have a different take on this because i always hated preppy, popular kids with fake smiles. still do at my old age. no offense, if these are your friends, but you''ve really stopped me in my tracks here!  don''t worry, high rating!', '2003-09-20 00:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(424489, 38020, 10260, '<td valign="top">Clever shot.  I''m wondering how in the world you did this.</td>', 'Clever shot.  I''m wondering how in the world you did this.', '2003-09-20 00:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(424490, 37611, 9168, '<td valign="top">Dang, there goes my macro shot!</td>', 'Dang, there goes my macro shot!', '2003-09-20 00:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(424491, 38159, 10260, '<td valign="top">This could have been a cute photo, out of the plastic, and in a wicker basket. Just a thought.  The ugly plastic really takes away from the "ahhhhhh" of the kitties.</td>', 'This could have been a cute photo, out of the plastic, and in a wicker basket. Just a thought.  The ugly plastic really takes away from the "ahhhhhh" of the kitties.', '2003-09-20 01:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(424492, 38178, 6388, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote on this challenge, but I did look at all the pictures, and this is hands down (pardon the pun) the best of the lot.  Compositionally I think you nailed it - nice crop, great lines, nice DOF.  I think technically it could be improved a little - diffused light would eliminate the hot spots of the baby''s fingernails, and the reds seem a little overdone, accounting for some of the grain.  Really all it needed was better lighting, but giventhe subject I can see how that might be difficult.  I''d give it a 9, and I don''t give many of those.</td>', 'I didn''t vote on this challenge, but I did look at all the pictures, and this is hands down (pardon the pun) the best of the lot.  Compositionally I think you nailed it - nice crop, great lines, nice DOF.  I think technically it could be improved a little - diffused light would eliminate the hot spots of the baby''s fingernails, and the reds seem a little overdone, accounting for some of the grain.  Really all it needed was better lighting, but giventhe subject I can see how that might be difficult.  I''d give it a 9, and I don''t give many of those.', '2003-09-20 01:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(424493, 38177, 9168, '<td valign="top">Make limenade or lemonade?</td>', 'Make limenade or lemonade?', '2003-09-20 01:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(424495, 37500, 117, '<td valign="top">a mimic I like that</td>', 'a mimic I like that', '2003-09-20 01:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(424497, 37583, 9168, '<td valign="top">My son likes to put his wife in the backseat.  Hes very wise for a five year old! :)</td>', 'My son likes to put his wife in the backseat.  Hes very wise for a five year old! :)', '2003-09-20 01:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(424502, 37545, 6388, '<td valign="top">what an angel. love the look on his face. the background draws away from him i think.  something solid would put the attention back on him.  congratulations by the way :)<br/>Pedro</td>', 'what an angel. love the look on his face. the background draws away from him i think.  something solid would put the attention back on him.  congratulations by the way :)Pedro', '2003-09-20 01:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(424503, 37946, 10414, '<td valign="top">A beautiful, clear picture!!!!  :)    10</td>', 'A beautiful, clear picture!!!!  :)    10', '2003-09-20 01:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(424505, 37644, 10414, '<td valign="top">Hahahaha!!!!!   It took me a while to get it!!   A 10 for creativity!!   :)</td>', 'Hahahaha!!!!!   It took me a while to get it!!   A 10 for creativity!!   :)', '2003-09-20 01:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(424506, 37494, 6388, '<td valign="top">gotta be Arizona or Utah, which means it started out a brilliant red/orange - which makes me wonder why the olive duotone.  the choice of colour flattens the contrast a bit, and i think that detracts from the compositional contrast between the tree and the rock.  I shot one almost identical to this last week at Tonto NM :).  I''d like to see it in colour as well.<br/> <br/>Pedro</td>', 'gotta be Arizona or Utah, which means it started out a brilliant red/orange - which makes me wonder why the olive duotone.  the choice of colour flattens the contrast a bit, and i think that detracts from the compositional contrast between the tree and the rock.  I shot one almost identical to this last week at Tonto NM :).  I''d like to see it in colour as well. Pedro', '2003-09-20 01:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(424507, 37313, 10414, '<td valign="top">Wow....my dream home!!!!!!!   10</td>', 'Wow....my dream home!!!!!!!   10', '2003-09-20 01:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(424508, 37833, 6388, '<td valign="top">i think a fill-flash would have done wonders for this.  it would illuminate the flower without losing the silhouetting on the trees in the background.  really like the setup though.<br/>Pedro</td>', 'i think a fill-flash would have done wonders for this.  it would illuminate the flower without losing the silhouetting on the trees in the background.  really like the setup though.Pedro', '2003-09-20 01:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(424513, 37997, 6388, '<td valign="top">this looks a little soft, and i think it''s because the colour saturation has been pushed a bit too much.  that could either be photoshop or your camera.  running an unsharp mask filter would help this.  once before you resize it, and again after.</td>', 'this looks a little soft, and i think it''s because the colour saturation has been pushed a bit too much.  that could either be photoshop or your camera.  running an unsharp mask filter would help this.  once before you resize it, and again after.', '2003-09-20 01:51:59.000000', NULL, 1);
