(424605, 37878, 2716, '<td valign="top">I think this is a bit of a stretch, but I don''t blame your for posting it.    Great lines and I  love the play with the shallow DOF.  Good luck.  Jacko.  8</td>', 'I think this is a bit of a stretch, but I don''t blame your for posting it.    Great lines and I  love the play with the shallow DOF.  Good luck.  Jacko.  8', '2003-09-20 07:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(424607, 38105, 2716, '<td valign="top">I love it.  the combination of colors and the angle makes this a great shot.  Good luck.</td>', 'I love it.  the combination of colors and the angle makes this a great shot.  Good luck.', '2003-09-20 07:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(424609, 38029, 2716, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Love the shallow depth of field.  The angle of the flower and the mix of colour is wonderful.  Very nice shot. 8</td>', 'Very nice.  Love the shallow depth of field.  The angle of the flower and the mix of colour is wonderful.  Very nice shot. 8', '2003-09-20 07:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(424611, 38135, 9643, '<td valign="top">All babies are sweet and beautiful, of course, but this little guy is awesome.  The textures you captured in this picture are so outstanding that I had to give this a 10.  I am personally envious of the quality here and have not yet learned how to do it.  I hope this is your baby.</td>', 'All babies are sweet and beautiful, of course, but this little guy is awesome.  The textures you captured in this picture are so outstanding that I had to give this a 10.  I am personally envious of the quality here and have not yet learned how to do it.  I hope this is your baby.', '2003-09-20 08:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(424612, 38167, 9643, '<td valign="top">The more I looked at this, the more I liked the cropping.  It captures the pause in the movement of the bird.  The wingspan on these gulls when they are landing still amazes me -( I''m a "beachsider" in FL on the Atlantic so I see them all of the time)</td>', 'The more I looked at this, the more I liked the cropping.  It captures the pause in the movement of the bird.  The wingspan on these gulls when they are landing still amazes me -( I''m a "beachsider" in FL on the Atlantic so I see them all of the time)', '2003-09-20 08:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(424613, 37811, 9643, '<td valign="top">This is the most creative and amazing shot in the challenge IMO and I can''t wait to see how it was done.  10</td>', 'This is the most creative and amazing shot in the challenge IMO and I can''t wait to see how it was done.  10', '2003-09-20 08:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(424615, 37529, 9643, '<td valign="top">This picture is wonderful!  It makes questions in my head faster than raindrops and I definitely would hang it. The variety of white and grey tones give it great wash appeal I think but it comes out on my screen a little too flat. I do wish the skin of the man''s arm was a little less in the direct sun.  The face of the man is handsome, warm and invitational and makes me want to talk to himd.  I am not that fond of the title but that''s a minor consideration.  I enjoy this photo very much.</td>', 'This picture is wonderful!  It makes questions in my head faster than raindrops and I definitely would hang it. The variety of white and grey tones give it great wash appeal I think but it comes out on my screen a little too flat. I do wish the skin of the man''s arm was a little less in the direct sun.  The face of the man is handsome, warm and invitational and makes me want to talk to himd.  I am not that fond of the title but that''s a minor consideration.  I enjoy this photo very much.', '2003-09-20 08:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(424616, 38090, 9643, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful young man and a wonderful shot of him.  Your title says it all for moms (and grandmoms).  I am envious of the clarity you achieved here - I get it only once in awhile.</td>', 'What a beautiful young man and a wonderful shot of him.  Your title says it all for moms (and grandmoms).  I am envious of the clarity you achieved here - I get it only once in awhile.', '2003-09-20 08:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(424618, 38065, 9643, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of this obviously photogenic subject.  Your title provides the relevancy to the challenge and the clarity and texture of the portrait warrents a high score.  It''s a photo that I enjoy looking at even though I don''t know the subject.</td>', 'Nice capture of this obviously photogenic subject.  Your title provides the relevancy to the challenge and the clarity and texture of the portrait warrents a high score.  It''s a photo that I enjoy looking at even though I don''t know the subject.', '2003-09-20 09:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(424623, 38176, 8367, '<td valign="top">Good find. B&amp;W is a good choice.</td>', 'Good find. B&W is a good choice.', '2003-09-20 10:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(424630, 38135, 3981, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful shot and a beautiful baby. Lighting is good and clarity is near perfect.  I can''t find anything wrong with it.  Good Luck!</td>', 'What a beautiful shot and a beautiful baby. Lighting is good and clarity is near perfect.  I can''t find anything wrong with it.  Good Luck!', '2003-09-20 11:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(424632, 38183, 3981, '<td valign="top">This one peaks my interest!  A very unusual shot, and I''m anxious to know where it was taken.  My only criticism is that the colors seem a bit washed out - faded. Perhaps it is the lighting.  Nevertheless, this is one of my favorites this week.  I love the ethereal feel to it.  Good Luck!</td>', 'This one peaks my interest!  A very unusual shot, and I''m anxious to know where it was taken.  My only criticism is that the colors seem a bit washed out - faded. Perhaps it is the lighting.  Nevertheless, this is one of my favorites this week.  I love the ethereal feel to it.  Good Luck!', '2003-09-20 11:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(424633, 38193, 3981, '<td valign="top">Fabulous photo!  The clarity is so good I can almost touch that adorable kitty. This one should do well this week.  Good luck!  PS: Cropping is excellent.</td>', 'Fabulous photo!  The clarity is so good I can almost touch that adorable kitty. This one should do well this week.  Good luck!  PS: Cropping is excellent.', '2003-09-20 11:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(424635, 38153, 3981, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!  Good cropping! Clarity is a bit fuzzy, but nevertheless a 7 from me.  Good luck!</td>', 'Nice shot!  Good cropping! Clarity is a bit fuzzy, but nevertheless a 7 from me.  Good luck!', '2003-09-20 11:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(424640, 38080, 11295, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape. I really like the use of the frame here. It carries over the colour of the setting sun higer. In this case, that really works well.</td>', 'Nice landscape. I really like the use of the frame here. It carries over the colour of the setting sun higer. In this case, that really works well.', '2003-09-20 12:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(424641, 37971, 11295, '<td valign="top">While the colours are nice, this seems too chaotic and insubstantial to convey an idea of ''life'' to me...</td>', 'While the colours are nice, this seems too chaotic and insubstantial to convey an idea of ''life'' to me...', '2003-09-20 12:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(424642, 37912, 11295, '<td valign="top">Creepy... it looks like a wooden moose. The lighting in this one is sweet.</td>', 'Creepy... it looks like a wooden moose. The lighting in this one is sweet.', '2003-09-20 12:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(424644, 38040, 11295, '<td valign="top">Great portrait!</td>', 'Great portrait!', '2003-09-20 12:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
