(424872, 37295, 472, '<td valign="top">nice perfect simplicity</td>', 'nice perfect simplicity', '2003-09-21 00:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(424873, 38183, 10402, '<td valign="top">Most photos I''ve seen of this pool have the water perfectly still. I like the ripples here, like someone is actually using it!</td>', 'Most photos I''ve seen of this pool have the water perfectly still. I like the ripples here, like someone is actually using it!', '2003-09-21 00:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(424874, 38131, 10402, '<td valign="top">Great symbolism here. The rose fills most of the frame with the thorns playing a minor part off to the side. Life is the same, even though we seem to remember the pricks more vividly than the sweet scent. I love the effect of the fine droplets in this image.</td>', 'Great symbolism here. The rose fills most of the frame with the thorns playing a minor part off to the side. Life is the same, even though we seem to remember the pricks more vividly than the sweet scent. I love the effect of the fine droplets in this image.', '2003-09-21 00:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(424875, 37803, 10402, '<td valign="top">There is no "center of interest" here, but I''m not sure it needs one. There are enough interesting things to keep a viewer''s interest for quite awhile.</td>', 'There is no "center of interest" here, but I''m not sure it needs one. There are enough interesting things to keep a viewer''s interest for quite awhile.', '2003-09-21 01:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(424877, 37946, 10402, '<td valign="top">There is a hint of motion in the back girl''s hair; a bit of motion blur would have been nice, but would probably have obscured their faces, so I guess a hint will have to do. Nice use of color.</td>', 'There is a hint of motion in the back girl''s hair; a bit of motion blur would have been nice, but would probably have obscured their faces, so I guess a hint will have to do. Nice use of color.', '2003-09-21 01:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(424878, 37705, 10402, '<td valign="top">The subjects are interesting, but the composition doesn''t work very well for me. There is no apparent reason to leave so much space on the left and crop the right side so tightly.</td>', 'The subjects are interesting, but the composition doesn''t work very well for me. There is no apparent reason to leave so much space on the left and crop the right side so tightly.', '2003-09-21 01:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(424879, 38065, 472, '<td valign="top">fantastic portrait. great light focus detail and composition</td>', 'fantastic portrait. great light focus detail and composition', '2003-09-21 01:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(424882, 37893, 10402, '<td valign="top">This is a striking and beautiful image. The birds aren''t really the subject of the photo, but they do certainly add an element of interest, as do the almost invisibly small people on the beach.</td>', 'This is a striking and beautiful image. The birds aren''t really the subject of the photo, but they do certainly add an element of interest, as do the almost invisibly small people on the beach.', '2003-09-21 01:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(424883, 37690, 472, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors. nice soft dreamy quality</td>', 'beautiful colors. nice soft dreamy quality', '2003-09-21 01:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(424885, 38000, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the statement you''re making here, but belive it can be made more effectively.  Though the ugly color cast and high noise level helps to define your feelings, I don''t believe that a mere collection of symbolic objects helps to state your case. In addition, though I believe the substance in the lower left to be illicit drugs, it''s not entirely clear what it is.</td>', 'I like the statement you''re making here, but belive it can be made more effectively.  Though the ugly color cast and high noise level helps to define your feelings, I don''t believe that a mere collection of symbolic objects helps to state your case. In addition, though I believe the substance in the lower left to be illicit drugs, it''s not entirely clear what it is.', '2003-09-21 01:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(424886, 37861, 10402, '<td valign="top">The play elements are a bit busy, but nicely frame the model and his bright colors help attract the viewer''s attention.</td>', 'The play elements are a bit busy, but nicely frame the model and his bright colors help attract the viewer''s attention.', '2003-09-21 01:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(424887, 37739, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great lighting. It really bring out the the beautiful shadows in the skeleton. The shadows give the picture a great depth of field. Even with the similar background color the skeleton still pops out of the image. The lighting really helps with this.</td>', 'Great lighting. It really bring out the the beautiful shadows in the skeleton. The shadows give the picture a great depth of field. Even with the similar background color the skeleton still pops out of the image. The lighting really helps with this.', '2003-09-21 01:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(424889, 37654, 10402, '<td valign="top">Good stop action shot. The crown is well formed and very symmetrical, and I like the reflection. I wish it was centered.</td>', 'Good stop action shot. The crown is well formed and very symmetrical, and I like the reflection. I wish it was centered.', '2003-09-21 01:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(424891, 37360, 10402, '<td valign="top">This photo needs something to attract and hold a viewer''s attention.</td>', 'This photo needs something to attract and hold a viewer''s attention.', '2003-09-21 01:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(424892, 38074, 10402, '<td valign="top">When you have a newborn, that''s your life for awhile! I like the composition and the pose.</td>', 'When you have a newborn, that''s your life for awhile! I like the composition and the pose.', '2003-09-21 01:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(424894, 37762, 5822, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure there is a cogent statement being made here, but if I''m wrong and there is, I don''t like it.  To me, the title is flippant and makes a statement that life is cheap. It''s insensitive.   I also don''t like the use of bright colors or the flag here. I think the use of B&amp;W would have been more appropriate.</td>', 'I''m not sure there is a cogent statement being made here, but if I''m wrong and there is, I don''t like it.  To me, the title is flippant and makes a statement that life is cheap. It''s insensitive.   I also don''t like the use of bright colors or the flag here. I think the use of B&W would have been more appropriate.', '2003-09-21 01:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(424895, 37968, 10402, '<td valign="top">At least it isn''t the king that is down; life can go on! Well, it''s obvious this isn''t a real game since the pieces aren''t on the squares, but it is a nice still life. The way the pieces refract the light and the board reflects it makes this image very attractive.</td>', 'At least it isn''t the king that is down; life can go on! Well, it''s obvious this isn''t a real game since the pieces aren''t on the squares, but it is a nice still life. The way the pieces refract the light and the board reflects it makes this image very attractive.', '2003-09-21 01:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(424898, 38155, 5822, '<td valign="top">Though the left eye is cut off I like the composition and tight crop of the baby''s face. The highly pixelated and compression artifacts detract.</td>', 'Though the left eye is cut off I like the composition and tight crop of the baby''s face. The highly pixelated and compression artifacts detract.', '2003-09-21 02:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(424900, 38176, 8953, '<td valign="top">Very Emotive shot. There are alot of distractions that take from this. the light pole? shadow, the sign running off the image to the left, the crop on the right. I give this a six just the same because it does speak of life to me.</td>', 'Very Emotive shot. There are alot of distractions that take from this. the light pole? shadow, the sign running off the image to the left, the crop on the right. I give this a six just the same because it does speak of life to me.', '2003-09-21 02:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
