(426611, 38082, 4411, '<td valign="top">The universe is a marble and ''God'' is a big wooden figure. I can relate : )<br/> <br/>On a serious note, I like that the figure and desaturation means that ''God'' is portrayed as having no discernable gender, race, or colour.<br/>Photo-wise, the composition, focus/DoF and exposure (especially the blown out area on the left side of the marble) are all spot on. Not 100% sure about the yellow, would be interesting to play about with hue-shifting that. Still, gotta give this full marks.</td>', 'The universe is a marble and ''God'' is a big wooden figure. I can relate : ) On a serious note, I like that the figure and desaturation means that ''God'' is portrayed as having no discernable gender, race, or colour.Photo-wise, the composition, focus/DoF and exposure (especially the blown out area on the left side of the marble) are all spot on. Not 100% sure about the yellow, would be interesting to play about with hue-shifting that. Still, gotta give this full marks.', '2003-09-22 20:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(426613, 38110, 12226, '<td valign="top">Looks like fun.</td>', 'Looks like fun.', '2003-09-22 20:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(426616, 38145, 12226, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.  I love the little buggers.</td>', 'Nice capture.  I love the little buggers.', '2003-09-22 20:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(426621, 37892, 12226, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.</td>', 'Nice photo.', '2003-09-22 20:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(426623, 37631, 12226, '<td valign="top">beautiful composition.</td>', 'beautiful composition.', '2003-09-22 20:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(426630, 37785, 117, '<td valign="top">I don''t know who expression I like the mostl? Excellent capture like this image.</td>', 'I don''t know who expression I like the mostl? Excellent capture like this image.', '2003-09-22 20:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(426634, 38087, 117, '<td valign="top">well I am big boy and I cry</td>', 'well I am big boy and I cry', '2003-09-22 20:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(426636, 37997, 117, '<td valign="top">Nice color like the angle</td>', 'Nice color like the angle', '2003-09-22 20:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(426637, 37619, 117, '<td valign="top">I think a better angle would be better at least to see the subject head or eyes in a focus.</td>', 'I think a better angle would be better at least to see the subject head or eyes in a focus.', '2003-09-22 20:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(426665, 38031, 6870, '<td valign="top">Plato would be proud! But perhaps a little annoyed at the wonderfully kitchy sunflower used. I''m not! 9</td>', 'Plato would be proud! But perhaps a little annoyed at the wonderfully kitchy sunflower used. I''m not! 9', '2003-09-22 21:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(426668, 38177, 6870, '<td valign="top">Makes me thirsty! Yum! Nice colors. You could try to lighten up the background and diffusing the light for a "fresher'' look perhaps. Well done.</td>', 'Makes me thirsty! Yum! Nice colors. You could try to lighten up the background and diffusing the light for a "fresher'' look perhaps. Well done.', '2003-09-22 21:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(426669, 37805, 6870, '<td valign="top">Moooooooover over Ansel Adams! Wonderful tones and gentle colors here.</td>', 'Moooooooover over Ansel Adams! Wonderful tones and gentle colors here.', '2003-09-22 21:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(426671, 37739, 6870, '<td valign="top">Charming photo and toothpaste use. Had you considered a black background? This is a fun idea and shot.</td>', 'Charming photo and toothpaste use. Had you considered a black background? This is a fun idea and shot.', '2003-09-22 21:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(426673, 37754, 6870, '<td valign="top">Superb composition. Harsh lighting, perhaps, but what a lovely capture!</td>', 'Superb composition. Harsh lighting, perhaps, but what a lovely capture!', '2003-09-22 21:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(426702, 37500, 10402, '<td valign="top">Great execution of your idea. The space in front of the chest, the angle of the chest compared to the floor tiles, the darkness of the chest compared to everything else, and the pose and expression of the model combine to make a very successful image.</td>', 'Great execution of your idea. The space in front of the chest, the angle of the chest compared to the floor tiles, the darkness of the chest compared to everything else, and the pose and expression of the model combine to make a very successful image.', '2003-09-22 21:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(426709, 38158, 10402, '<td valign="top">The silhouetted tree contrasts nicely with the dramatic sky.</td>', 'The silhouetted tree contrasts nicely with the dramatic sky.', '2003-09-22 21:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(426714, 38154, 4340, '<td valign="top">that''s really cool looking.  I like the design and light</td>', 'that''s really cool looking.  I like the design and light', '2003-09-22 21:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(426719, 38131, 4340, '<td valign="top">good analogy.  the white spots on the rose a bit distracting</td>', 'good analogy.  the white spots on the rose a bit distracting', '2003-09-22 22:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(426724, 37295, 10402, '<td valign="top">The white rails lead the viewer''s eye right to the subjects and the texture of the walkway behind them contrasts nicely with the texture of the water in front. The overall image seems a bit blurry and I wish the man''s jacket wasn''t white. The gaudy frame actually works here.</td>', 'The white rails lead the viewer''s eye right to the subjects and the texture of the walkway behind them contrasts nicely with the texture of the water in front. The overall image seems a bit blurry and I wish the man''s jacket wasn''t white. The gaudy frame actually works here.', '2003-09-22 22:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(426725, 37997, 4340, '<td valign="top">i like the colors</td>', 'i like the colors', '2003-09-22 22:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(426737, 37766, 4340, '<td valign="top">would like to see more closeup of the people and less of the water</td>', 'would like to see more closeup of the people and less of the water', '2003-09-22 22:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(426738, 37503, 10402, '<td valign="top">This great low key photo needs just a bit more contrast.</td>', 'This great low key photo needs just a bit more contrast.', '2003-09-22 22:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(426740, 38014, 4340, '<td valign="top">beautiful macro</td>', 'beautiful macro', '2003-09-22 22:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(426741, 37530, 4340, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition and colors</td>', 'I really like the composition and colors', '2003-09-22 22:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(426769, 37974, 6668, '<td valign="top">Photo is waay to small.</td>', 'Photo is waay to small.', '2003-09-22 22:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(426772, 37740, 6668, '<td valign="top">flowers seem a little overexposed.</td>', 'flowers seem a little overexposed.', '2003-09-22 22:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(426774, 38000, 6668, '<td valign="top">Photo is waaay to grainy, interesting idea.</td>', 'Photo is waaay to grainy, interesting idea.', '2003-09-22 23:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(426776, 37878, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautifully focused shot. Love the details in the chain. You can almost feel the texture of the chain. Love the frame that you chose for the framing. It really works in sync with the great depth of field to bring your eyes to the center of the image.</td>', 'Beautifully focused shot. Love the details in the chain. You can almost feel the texture of the chain. Love the frame that you chose for the framing. It really works in sync with the great depth of field to bring your eyes to the center of the image.', '2003-09-22 23:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(426777, 37556, 10084, '<td valign="top">Almost looks like a watercolored painting with little sharpness. The top column distracts from the picture. A bit dark to notice the details.</td>', 'Almost looks like a watercolored painting with little sharpness. The top column distracts from the picture. A bit dark to notice the details.', '2003-09-22 23:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(426779, 37893, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful silhouette of the seagulls. The lighting is extremely beautiful. Love the sky and the great clouds that you captured. The reflections in the water and the bright sun really adds to the picture.</td>', 'Beautiful silhouette of the seagulls. The lighting is extremely beautiful. Love the sky and the great clouds that you captured. The reflections in the water and the bright sun really adds to the picture.', '2003-09-22 23:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(426781, 38009, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful closeup of the dog. Love the dark background . It really helps to bring the dog out of the picture. The shadows and reflections on the dog really shows the furriness of it. Very interesting composition.</td>', 'Beautiful closeup of the dog. Love the dark background . It really helps to bring the dog out of the picture. The shadows and reflections on the dog really shows the furriness of it. Very interesting composition.', '2003-09-22 23:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(426783, 37583, 10084, '<td valign="top">Good depth of field really help to make the vehicle pop out of the picture. I think a little less light would give the piece more impact. You can achieve some beautiful shadows in the car and it would really give more impact in the image.</td>', 'Good depth of field really help to make the vehicle pop out of the picture. I think a little less light would give the piece more impact. You can achieve some beautiful shadows in the car and it would really give more impact in the image.', '2003-09-22 23:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(426787, 38154, 6668, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot...I love the lighting, and the frame adds a really nice finishing touch to this photo.</td>', 'Beautiful shot...I love the lighting, and the frame adds a really nice finishing touch to this photo.', '2003-09-22 23:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(426791, 38078, 6668, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped the top of the photo a little more to get rid of the orange part of the wall.</td>', 'I would have cropped the top of the photo a little more to get rid of the orange part of the wall.', '2003-09-22 23:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(426792, 37734, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very clear picture. You can read every word on the sign. I like how the sign is crooked. It gives great interest to the image. It would be nice to see the horizon straighten a bit. You would probably get a greater shot. Beautiful clouds and beach. A larger image would be more pleasing to the eye.</td>', 'Very clear picture. You can read every word on the sign. I like how the sign is crooked. It gives great interest to the image. It would be nice to see the horizon straighten a bit. You would probably get a greater shot. Beautiful clouds and beach. A larger image would be more pleasing to the eye.', '2003-09-22 23:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(426796, 37386, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful macro of a mushroom. Great detail on the head of the mushroom. The great depth of field really makes the mushroom stand out. Lighting is incredible.</td>', 'Beautiful macro of a mushroom. Great detail on the head of the mushroom. The great depth of field really makes the mushroom stand out. Lighting is incredible.', '2003-09-22 23:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(426797, 37271, 6668, '<td valign="top">Why is the top of her head cut off?  Was it cropped that way or was that the way it was taken? Anyway, it would be much better if her face was not cut off.</td>', 'Why is the top of her head cut off?  Was it cropped that way or was that the way it was taken? Anyway, it would be much better if her face was not cut off.', '2003-09-22 23:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(426800, 37721, 6668, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I understand the formation the flowers are in, is it significant?</td>', 'I''m not sure I understand the formation the flowers are in, is it significant?', '2003-09-22 23:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(426840, 38193, 10084, '<td valign="top">The great depth of field really brings the kitten out of the picture. The sharpness of the kittens fur really is beautiful. The reflections in the eyes really make the photo. Absolutely incredible picture.</td>', 'The great depth of field really brings the kitten out of the picture. The sharpness of the kittens fur really is beautiful. The reflections in the eyes really make the photo. Absolutely incredible picture.', '2003-09-23 00:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(426842, 37283, 10084, '<td valign="top">The candlelighting really gives these shot a great atmosphere. Absolutely beautiful shadows and reflections make the image come alive. This would make for a great inspirational greeting card or postcard.</td>', 'The candlelighting really gives these shot a great atmosphere. Absolutely beautiful shadows and reflections make the image come alive. This would make for a great inspirational greeting card or postcard.', '2003-09-23 00:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(426844, 37959, 10402, '<td valign="top">But I want to see the baby''s face!! Seriously, this is a nice intimate photo. Sepia works well. Lighting is too harsh.</td>', 'But I want to see the baby''s face!! Seriously, this is a nice intimate photo. Sepia works well. Lighting is too harsh.', '2003-09-23 00:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(426849, 37965, 10402, '<td valign="top">Everyone knows that toes are tastier than thumbs! Perfect high key exposure and pleasing composition.</td>', 'Everyone knows that toes are tastier than thumbs! Perfect high key exposure and pleasing composition.', '2003-09-23 00:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(426855, 38151, 10402, '<td valign="top">I like your interpretation of life, but wish I had such a good vantage point! Great control of DOF really makes this photo. The fuzzy parts at the rear almost look three-dimensional.</td>', 'I like your interpretation of life, but wish I had such a good vantage point! Great control of DOF really makes this photo. The fuzzy parts at the rear almost look three-dimensional.', '2003-09-23 00:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(426863, 38120, 10402, '<td valign="top">You captured the action nicely, but the background is a bit distracting. Some judicious cropping could eliminate the distraction and focus the viewer''s attention on the subject.</td>', 'You captured the action nicely, but the background is a bit distracting. Some judicious cropping could eliminate the distraction and focus the viewer''s attention on the subject.', '2003-09-23 00:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(426880, 37556, 9232, '<td valign="top">This photo suffers from poor composition with the lines between the board at the top of the image and the oblique line at the bottom left in seeming contention with the parallel lines in the tiles on the floor.  The focus is soft and the lighting is sporadic across the whole image.  The photos is definitely a snapshot of life but it is not a great composition.</td>', 'This photo suffers from poor composition with the lines between the board at the top of the image and the oblique line at the bottom left in seeming contention with the parallel lines in the tiles on the floor.  The focus is soft and the lighting is sporadic across the whole image.  The photos is definitely a snapshot of life but it is not a great composition.', '2003-09-23 01:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(426883, 37893, 9232, '<td valign="top">I like the color and the silhouettes of the birds but I think it would have been more moving to only see one bird.  I like the clouds slightly below the horizontal middle.  The lens flare works in this composition.  6</td>', 'I like the color and the silhouettes of the birds but I think it would have been more moving to only see one bird.  I like the clouds slightly below the horizontal middle.  The lens flare works in this composition.  6', '2003-09-23 01:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(426885, 37500, 12103, '<td valign="top">Very nice</td>', 'Very nice', '2003-09-23 01:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(426887, 38184, 9232, '<td valign="top">Good subjects but its ironic that all the dogs are looking up while one of the children is looking down and one is looking away.  Good ambient light but if this was cropped a little closer on both sides and the top the odd shadows wouldn''t be as noticable around the plants.</td>', 'Good subjects but its ironic that all the dogs are looking up while one of the children is looking down and one is looking away.  Good ambient light but if this was cropped a little closer on both sides and the top the odd shadows wouldn''t be as noticable around the plants.', '2003-09-23 01:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(426889, 38080, 9232, '<td valign="top">Creative approach to the challenge topic.  I like the balanced lack of symmetry.  The two hillside silhouettes at the bottom of the photo offset each other and I like the small fringe of darkness across the middle at the bottom of the photo.  Good range of colors and textures in the clouds, too.</td>', 'Creative approach to the challenge topic.  I like the balanced lack of symmetry.  The two hillside silhouettes at the bottom of the photo offset each other and I like the small fringe of darkness across the middle at the bottom of the photo.  Good range of colors and textures in the clouds, too.', '2003-09-23 01:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(426890, 38177, 9232, '<td valign="top">Good subject.  The lighting in this shot is a slight problem.  I like the highlights that show in the liquid as it falls into the glass, the lime slice on the glass and the lime.  The strong shadow that falls from the glass across the lime on the left of the picture detracts from the overall quality.  The pleasant background is offset by the active pattern in the placemat below the subjects.  The placemat also appears to have some crumb on it just behind and to the right of the glass.  I think you have a good composition here but replace the placemat with a solid cloth and give a little more fill light to the lefthand side of the composition so that the lime isn''t lost in the glass'' shadow.</td>', 'Good subject.  The lighting in this shot is a slight problem.  I like the highlights that show in the liquid as it falls into the glass, the lime slice on the glass and the lime.  The strong shadow that falls from the glass across the lime on the left of the picture detracts from the overall quality.  The pleasant background is offset by the active pattern in the placemat below the subjects.  The placemat also appears to have some crumb on it just behind and to the right of the glass.  I think you have a good composition here but replace the placemat with a solid cloth and give a little more fill light to the lefthand side of the composition so that the lime isn''t lost in the glass'' shadow.', '2003-09-23 01:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(426891, 38154, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting gives this shot a really nice composition. Love the halo in the fishbowl that surrounds the roots. Amazing silohuette.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting gives this shot a really nice composition. Love the halo in the fishbowl that surrounds the roots. Amazing silohuette.', '2003-09-23 01:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(426893, 37690, 9232, '<td valign="top">Great subject, nice composition.  I like the choice of a portrait look at this with the vines and the bricks in contention because of their lateral nature.  This would garner a top score from me except for the lack of definition in the highlights at the top of the image.  A little too much light on the red leaves washes out some of their details.  I''d love to see this shot after you played around and burned in some of the red leaves just a little.  Once again, good choice of subjects and great choice of artistic presentation with the portrait cropping.</td>', 'Great subject, nice composition.  I like the choice of a portrait look at this with the vines and the bricks in contention because of their lateral nature.  This would garner a top score from me except for the lack of definition in the highlights at the top of the image.  A little too much light on the red leaves washes out some of their details.  I''d love to see this shot after you played around and burned in some of the red leaves just a little.  Once again, good choice of subjects and great choice of artistic presentation with the portrait cropping.', '2003-09-23 01:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(426936, 38190, 9251, '<td valign="top">beautiful!</td>', 'beautiful!', '2003-09-23 02:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
