(427113, 37878, 7543, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. DOF put to good use, the subject very interesting. Background nicely blurred out and the B/W-Sepia mix is just right. The frame is also very nice, in spite of the fact I usually dont like this kind of "transparent" frames, very tastefully done here. The only thing negative I have to say is that I seems a bit shue-horned into the challenge with the title, I have to give it a -1 for that. This shot could defenetly sell for postcards or for something else, might even go for a webpage graphics. Nice job (8) - Good luck</td>', 'Very nice shot. DOF put to good use, the subject very interesting. Background nicely blurred out and the B/W-Sepia mix is just right. The frame is also very nice, in spite of the fact I usually dont like this kind of "transparent" frames, very tastefully done here. The only thing negative I have to say is that I seems a bit shue-horned into the challenge with the title, I have to give it a -1 for that. This shot could defenetly sell for postcards or for something else, might even go for a webpage graphics. Nice job (8) - Good luck', '2003-09-23 11:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
