(430085, 38036, 10985, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by WhidbeyPix:</b></div><hr/><i>I like the lighting, but composition is a bit off.. too much black space at top.</i></td></tr></table> Thanks so much for the comment. I did mean to have this much negative space, though. Photography is so subjective, not everyone can like everything. That''s part of its beauty.</td>', 'Originally posted by WhidbeyPix:I like the lighting, but composition is a bit off.. too much black space at top. Thanks so much for the comment. I did mean to have this much negative space, though. Photography is so subjective, not everyone can like everything. That''s part of its beauty.', '2003-09-25 09:06:24.000000', NULL, 0),
