(430610, 38036, 4639, '<td valign="top">I really like the negative space at the top of this image Louison. I can only suggest that you dodge out the left left edge that goes out of frame and possibly the right and bottom too. This might add a floating feeling to your subject while still eluding to a grounded sense because of the the top blackness.</td>', 'I really like the negative space at the top of this image Louison. I can only suggest that you dodge out the left left edge that goes out of frame and possibly the right and bottom too. This might add a floating feeling to your subject while still eluding to a grounded sense because of the the top blackness.', '2003-09-25 17:27:27.000000', NULL, 0),
