(432749, 38194, 12260, '<td valign="top">Thank you for your comments on my photo. They are very helpful, several things were pointed out that I didnt realize. Being new to dp I have a lot to learn and I am looking forward to all comments or suggestions that will help me to become a better photographer. :)</td>', 'Thank you for your comments on my photo. They are very helpful, several things were pointed out that I didnt realize. Being new to dp I have a lot to learn and I am looking forward to all comments or suggestions that will help me to become a better photographer. :)', '2003-09-27 21:44:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(432776, 37644, 1570, '<td valign="top">thanks a lot for all your helpful comments!</td>', 'thanks a lot for all your helpful comments!', '2003-09-27 22:50:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(432803, 37530, 7778, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments and interest, everyone!<br/> <br/>It''s a straightforward, handheld macro of some sort of succulent outdoor plant (hey, I''m no botanist). What triggered my initial interest was the translucency of the leaves against the midday sun. In order to capture it, I knelt on the soil (my knees are still dirty from it) and pointed the camera diagonally upward, with the sun at approx. 90 degrees. I''m happy some of you liked this image. I, too, feel, I''ve been fortunate with this one.<br/> <br/>PS: No equipment other than a # 2 ND on my camera was used.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-09-27 22:45:03.</i></td>', 'Thanks for all the comments and interest, everyone! It''s a straightforward, handheld macro of some sort of succulent outdoor plant (hey, I''m no botanist). What triggered my initial interest was the translucency of the leaves against the midday sun. In order to capture it, I knelt on the soil (my knees are still dirty from it) and pointed the camera diagonally upward, with the sun at approx. 90 degrees. I''m happy some of you liked this image. I, too, feel, I''ve been fortunate with this one. PS: No equipment other than a # 2 ND on my camera was used.', '2003-09-27 23:31:19.000000', '2003-09-27 23:45:03.000000', 0),
