(437276, 37295, 3867, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the 8 Pat.  And honestly, thanks for taking the time to comment also.  As for people not wasting their time to be nasty, I think that''s true most of the time although I have seen exceptions in other challenges.  In this challenge however I agree commenters were trying to be helpful though I suspect the four people who voted this a 1 were not among the commenters.  I have a tendancy to look at the persons portfolio before deciding whether or not to give creidence to there critique.  Perhaps, as you suggest, I should pay more attention to how the non-artist percieves the work since, after all, they do account for the voting majority.</td>', 'Thanks for the 8 Pat.  And honestly, thanks for taking the time to comment also.  As for people not wasting their time to be nasty, I think that''s true most of the time although I have seen exceptions in other challenges.  In this challenge however I agree commenters were trying to be helpful though I suspect the four people who voted this a 1 were not among the commenters.  I have a tendancy to look at the persons portfolio before deciding whether or not to give creidence to there critique.  Perhaps, as you suggest, I should pay more attention to how the non-artist percieves the work since, after all, they do account for the voting majority.', '2003-10-01 18:22:23.000000', NULL, 0),
