(600792, 37974, 6870, '<td valign="top">One reason it scored low was simply because many th ought it just didn''t say "LIFE" to them. Sure, the photo is small, and sure it could use a little sharpening, but the composition is tight, the mood is delightful, and the expression on the animal is priceless. Post another one!</td>', 'One reason it scored low was simply because many th ought it just didn''t say "LIFE" to them. Sure, the photo is small, and sure it could use a little sharpening, but the composition is tight, the mood is delightful, and the expression on the animal is priceless. Post another one!', '2004-02-26 23:54:40.000000', NULL, 0),
