(680648, 37754, 1041, '<td valign="top">I just saw your link to this with regards to BetterPhoto, it''s a stunning shot, and well deserving of a win over there.  The next thing I noticed is that you took this in Enfield ... I lived in Edmonton for a few years and often went to Enfield to go shopping.  The Kings Head used to be my "not-so-local local".  My (then) boy-friend grew up in Enfields.  Small world!  Brings back a lot of memories! :)  Anyhow, really just wanted to congratulate you (belatedly) on that wonderful shot!</td>', 'I just saw your link to this with regards to BetterPhoto, it''s a stunning shot, and well deserving of a win over there.  The next thing I noticed is that you took this in Enfield ... I lived in Edmonton for a few years and often went to Enfield to go shopping.  The Kings Head used to be my "not-so-local local".  My (then) boy-friend grew up in Enfields.  Small world!  Brings back a lot of memories! :)  Anyhow, really just wanted to congratulate you (belatedly) on that wonderful shot!', '2004-04-22 00:27:56.000000', NULL, 0),
